Fixes found on real devices.

On a tablet, and on a phone turned sideways, the app could open on an empty screen — the conversation list now stays until a conversation is open. Voice messages arrive as voice messages, and older ones that would not play repair themselves. The conversation's name is back in its header. On Android 10 and 11 the microphone closes when somebody calls you.

Forwarding a message shows conversations with pictures and a search box.
